            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kapaaran kaŋin, yenejai kuju togo, kojaas ikeboro toma togo, sirikijesun alemun; kwape kwaŋin yenejai mana sirikeboŋu kau, ",
          "type": "text",
